PTX tearing+vector.v2.u64
"A 16-byte relaxed vector store of two 64-bit elements and a 16-byte relaxed vector load of the same two locations. A strong vector access of at most 16 bytes is single-copy atomic (D43), so the load sees both new values or neither: forbidden."
{
a=0;
b=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0                      | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                         ;
 st.relaxed.gpu.v2.u64 a, b, 1, 1    | ld.relaxed.gpu.v2.u64 r0, r1, a, b     ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
